00:00:06.702 --> 00:00:08.410
STEVE GREENBERG:
Scikit-Learn and XGBoost

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.650
are machine-learning
frameworks as part

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.120
of the Python ecosystem.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.670
And I'm a huge fan
of these frameworks.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:16.780
I use them for my work.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:21.190
And I genuinely find
them to be a joy to use.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:24.520
If your experienced with
Scikit-Learn and XGBoost,

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.370
this talk is meant to give you
some practical tips for how

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.650
